442	## 7. 帧提交流程（HW Overlay 路径）
443	
444	### 7.1 帧数据流
445	
446	```mermaid
447	sequenceDiagram
448	    participant Src as 数据源<br/>(Camera/MediaPlayer)
449	    participant BQ_P as BQ Producer
450	    participant BQ_C as BQ Consumer
451	    participant SV as SurfaceView
452	    participant OV as Overlay Buffer
453	    participant LCD as LCD Controller
454	
455	    Src->>BQ_P: dequeue → fill → queue(frame)
456	    BQ_C-->>SV: on_frame_available() 回调
457	
458	    Note over SV: 在 LVGL 主循环或<br/>独立 timer 中处理
459	    SV->>BQ_C: acquire_buffer(&info)
460	    SV->>SV: graphic_buffer_lock(info.buffer, &vaddr)
461	
462	    alt 双缓冲
463	        SV->>OV: memcpy(back_buffer, vaddr, size)
464	        SV->>OV: ioctl(FBIOPAN_OVERLAY) 切换到 back
465	    else 单缓冲
466	        SV->>OV: memcpy(fbmem, vaddr, size)
467	        SV->>OV: ioctl(FBIOPAN_OVERLAY) 触发刷新
468	    end
469	
470	    SV->>SV: graphic_buffer_unlock()
471	    SV->>BQ_C: release_buffer(slot)
472	    SV->>SV: graphic_buffer_release(buffer)
473	
474	    LCD->>LCD: 硬件合成 Layer0(LVGL) + Layer1(Overlay)
475	```
